(A prequel to The Darjeeling Limited, 2007.)

8
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Jack Whitman, played by Jason Schwartzman.

9
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:57,000
Jack's Girlfriend, played by Natalie Portman.

10
